{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1505750-help-me-home-brew-dragon-blooded-occult-charms","id":1505750,"title":"Help me home brew Dragon Blooded occult charms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-18T21:08:25-07:00","id":1505750,"title":"Help me home brew Dragon Blooded occult charms","content":"The prerequisite for dragonblooded terrestrial circle sorcery is four other occult charms. For all but the strangest of characters, this is going to be met by the excellency and three other charms.<br /> <br /> There are nine other essence one and essence two occult charms published for dragonblooded. That gives us some possible variation,but I'd like to come up with one or two other ideas to make overlap of sorcerers less likely. I may never get around to running my Dragonblooded wizard's guild game, but i can still fiddle with things.<br /> <br /> Looking at the low essence solar occult charms I see that they get a way to speak old realm and thereby communicate with spirits, a way to access thaumaturgical rituals, and a way for a character to help spirits manifest.<br /> <br /> The Lunars can get bonuses to social influence rolls against a spirits, including bonuses to use lore to introduce facts about a spirit. They get a way to use thaumaturgy, and they get a charm about blood oaths.<br /> <br /> Sidereals have a method of decreasing attunement costs of artifacts.<br /> <br /> Is there any room to adapt something thematically similar to those abilities to the dragonblooded charm set? Do you have any other thematically appropriate charm ideas for dragonblooded? I am just looking for something to reduce the possibility of cookie cutter sorcerers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":872,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","user":"Apromor","date":". 03-19-2023, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T22:49:00-07:00","id":1505760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1505750-help-me-home-brew-dragon-blooded-occult-charms#post1505750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Looking at the low essence solar occult charms I see that they get way to speak old realm and thereby communicate with spirits, a way to access thaumaturgical rituals and a way for he character to help spirits manifest..<br /> <br /> The Lunars can get bonuses to social influence rolls against a spirit including bonuses to use lore to introduce facts about the spirit. a way to use thaumaturgy, and a thing with blood oaths.<br /> <br /> Sidereals have a method of decreasing attunement costs of artifacts.<br /> <br /> Is there any room to adapt something thematically similar to those abilities to the dragonblooded charm set? Do you have any thematically appropriate charm ideas for dragonblooded?</div> </div> </div> </div>For the spirit talking one, a Charm you could make is one that allows the DB to speak to elementals regardless of language. And then with a repurchase at a higher level, it can apply to other spirits as well. Charms to boost persuasion against Elementals would probably also work. and a Charm for decreasing Jade Artifact attunements is something I'm surprised the DBs don't already have, albeit at a much higher level (Lunars also have a version as well). Not sure about the other stuff, at least not for early levels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T20:22:58-07:00","id":1506006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1505750-help-me-home-brew-dragon-blooded-occult-charms#post1505750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sidereals have a method of decreasing attunement costs of artifacts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apologies for double posting, after going through Heirs of the Shogunate, it turns out that DBs do have an attunement cost reduction charm, its just for the combat abilities, and only affects artifact weapons. Theoretically, you could learn a version for Occult that removes the &quot;weapon&quot; qualifier and instead makes it Jade-only, but that's just one option.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}